# Maven build output, including target/pit-reports. The repo root has no `target` rule because
# nothing here was a Maven project before the engine. The three differential harnesses write their
# long-form reports to target/harness/, which is generated and therefore lands here.
target/

# The differential harnesses' unpacked OUTPUT: readable copies of the three frozen corpora, tens of
# megabytes, rebuilt by `node harness/unpack-fixtures.cjs` in seconds.
#
# harness/fixtures/ is NOT here and must not be. It is the frozen JavaScript answers themselves — the
# only surviving record of eleven node bodies that were deleted — plus the catalogues the three tests
# assert against. There is nothing left to regenerate them from. See harness/README.md.
harness/out/
